  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Præfertim cum præstet u-</l>
    <l n="2">num perire, quàm exercitum</l>
    <l n="3">universum funditus deleri: aut</l>
    <l n="4">unum periculo subjici, ut à rui-</l>
    <l n="5">nâ exercitus liberetur. Et certe</l>
    <l n="6">Christianum est, quam mini-</l>
    <l n="7">mâ sanguinis effusione, re-</l>
    <l n="8">demptam velle victoriam, li-</l>
    <l n="9">bertatem; quod eveniet, si sin-</l>
    <l n="10">gulari congressui detur locus.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Quinimo id incumbit offi-</l>
    <l n="12">cio Principis qui viribus ac</l>
    <l n="13">copiis impar est, ut suis consu-</l>
    <l n="14">lat, ac minori malo majus a-</l>
    <l n="15">vertat. Id vero facit, quando</l>
    <l n="16">hujusmodi conflictum insti-</l>
    <l n="17">tuit, qui pars est justi belli, ex</l>
    <l n="18">parte Principis laudanda, quo</l>
    <l n="19">casus dubius in spem transfe-</l>
    <l n="20">ratur victoriae.</l>
    <l n="21" para="true">Exempla insignia dabunt</l>
    <l n="22">historiae Gothorum Sueno-</l>
    <l n="23">numque. Attilus Suecorum</l>
    <l n="24">rex in Daniâ occurrit Frontino</l>
    <l n="25">Danici exercitus praefecto, in-</l>
    <l n="26">numeris copiis stipato, Fit diu-</l>
